连贯、减少停顿；过大可能失控\"\n - info=\"Ras阈值：↓更连贯更快，↑更克制防重复。逐字读可降至 0.10~0.12\""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [501.1159362792969, 164.6886749267578], "pos": [1748.1688232421875, 1723.1326904296875], "id": 37, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 35, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [292.2368469238281, 141.259033203125], "pos": [2083.191650390625, 1416.5262451171875], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 38}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [65], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["[S1] <|Sichuan|>你昨晚打呼噜像拖拉机哦！我都整得没法睡觉咯！  \n[S2] <|Sichuan|>你莫瞎说哦！明明是你在打呼噜！我都被震到地上咯！  \n[S1] <|Sichuan|>我才不打呼噜咧！  \n[S2] <|Sichuan|>那这个录音是啥子喃？你听哈！是咱家那只狗Buddy在打呼噜哦！  \n[S1] <|Sichuan|>啥子？它不是睡沙发上咩？  \n[S2] <|Sichuan|>它半夜自己溜进来咯！我们这不是白吵咯嘛！  "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [328.0542297363281, 239.67041015625], "pos": [512.7095947265625, 675.5604248046875], "id": 62, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [60], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["[S1]你昨晚打呼噜像拖拉机！我都没法睡！\n[S2] 胡说！明明是你！我都被震到地上了！\n[S1] 我从不打呼噜！\n[S2] 那这个录音呢？听！是咱家狗Buddy在打呼！\n[S1] 啊？它睡沙发啊！\n[S2]它半夜溜进来了！我们白吵了！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [328.0542297363281, 239.67041015625], "pos": [-482.493408203125, 2261.48193359375], "id": 50, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 26}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [1574.7121976433975, 106.06180813836272], "scale": 0.27941459537662483}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "全局参数", "bounding": [153.21270751953125, 594.6599731445312, 753.5363159179688, 568.6111450195312]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "方案一：SoulX-Podcast-普通话版", "bounding": [924.947998046875, 599.7132568359375, 1790.7586669921875, 677.4295043945312]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "方案二：MegaTTS3", "bounding": [-473.942138671875, 602.9675903320312, 611.6951904296875, 412.8304748535156]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "方案三：IndexTTS2", "bounding": [-1440.3487548828125, 606.5179443359375, 940.5220947265625, 972.954345703125]}, {"color": "#a1309b", "font_size": 88, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "声音克隆新模型支持方言和情绪（SouIX-Podcast）", "bounding": [225.8400421142578, 310.8674621582031, 2080.557861328125, 117.52236938476562]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "SoulX-Podcast-方言版", "bounding": [933.2034301757812, 1329.446044921875, 1489.512451171875, 993.020263671875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title